# Allow-list for `docker build -f services/keeper/Dockerfile .` from the repository root. Nothing reaches the
# Docker daemon unless it is named here: the working tree also holds local environment files, keys and evidence.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!contracts/abi/*.json
!contracts/deployment/hybrid-mainnet.json
!contracts/deployment/mainnet-addresses.json
!research/chainlink-streams-base.md
!services/keeper/*.mjs
